  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connex Support Unit II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Norwegian support to CONNEX is to assist the government in developing countries to negotiate large, complex investment contracts related to renewable energy production and infrastructure. This is done by the CONNEX secretariat (in GIZ) engaging consultants (experts in law, finance, technology) who support a country&apos;s authorities in negotiations with private companies that want to invest in the country.

Output 1: The CONNEX support measures were implemented in partner countries to a high quality standard. 
Output 2: Transactions supported by CONNEX yielded investments in renewable energy generation.</narrative>
  </description>
